        "root_concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "section": "nuclear",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Nuclear Physics for Engineers",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Mass defect and binding energy:**\n```\nB = (Z mₚ + N mₙ − M_nucleus) c²   [MeV]"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md#009",
      "path": [
        "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:nuclear:01-nuclear-physics, git-history:nuclear:01-nuclear-physics]",
        "canonical_path": "nuclear/01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md",
        "concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "current_path": "nuclear/01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:nuclear:nuclear-physics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "nuclear",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "section": "nuclear",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Nuclear Physics for Engineers",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "where:\n  mₚ = 938.272 MeV/c²  (proton rest mass)\n  mₙ = 939.565 MeV/c²  (neutron rest mass)\n  M_nucleus = actual nuclear mass\n  c² = 931.5 MeV/u (conversion)"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md#010",
      "path": [
        "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:nuclear:01-nuclear-physics, git-history:nuclear:01-nuclear-physics]",
        "canonical_path": "nuclear/01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md",
        "concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "current_path": "nuclear/01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:nuclear:nuclear-physics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "nuclear",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "section": "nuclear",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Nuclear Physics for Engineers",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Binding energy per nucleon B/A:\n  Peaks at ⁵⁶Fe (~8.8 MeV/nucleon)\n  → Fusing light nuclei (left of Fe): releases energy (fusion)\n  → Fissioning heavy nuclei (right of Fe): releases energy (fission)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md#011",
      "path": [
        "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:nuclear:01-nuclear-physics, git-history:nuclear:01-nuclear-physics]",
        "canonical_path": "nuclear/01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md",
        "concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "current_path": "nuclear/01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:nuclear:nuclear-physics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "nuclear",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "section": "nuclear",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Nuclear Physics for Engineers",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Semi-empirical mass formula (Bethe-Weizsäcker):**\n```\nB = a_V A − a_S A^(2/3) − a_C Z(Z−1)/A^(1/3) − a_A(A−2Z)²/A + δ"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md#012",
      "path": [
        "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:nuclear:01-nuclear-physics, git-history:nuclear:01-nuclear-physics]",
        "canonical_path": "nuclear/01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md",
        "concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "current_path": "nuclear/01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md",
        "id": "maxim:nuclear:nuclear-physics",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "nuclear",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[nuclear, physics]",
        "section": "nuclear",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Nuclear Physics for Engineers",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "a_V ≈ 15.56 MeV  (volume term: bulk nuclear attraction)\na_S ≈ 17.23 MeV  (surface term: surface nucleons less bound)\na_C ≈ 0.697 MeV  (Coulomb repulsion between protons)\na_A ≈ 23.3 MeV   (asymmetry: N ≈ Z preferred by Pauli exclusion)\nδ = pairing term (even-even nuclei most stable)\n```"
    },
