      "text": "**Alpha decay (A > 200):**\n```\nᴬ_Z X → ᴬ⁻⁴_{Z-2} Y + ⁴₂He + Q\nQ = B(daughter) + B(α) − B(parent)\nRange in air: few cm; stopped by paper\nHigh LET → high biological effectiveness\n```"
    },
