        "title": "01 - Nuclear Physics for Engineers",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Beta decay:**\n```\nβ⁻: n → p + e⁻ + ν̄_e  (excess neutrons: fission products)\nβ⁺: p → n + e⁺ + ν_e  (proton-rich nuclides)\nEC: p + e⁻ → n + ν_e   (electron capture, competes with β⁺)"
    },
