      "text": "where:\n  φ = neutron flux = n v  [neutrons/(cm²·s)]\n  n = neutron density [neutrons/cm³]\n  v = neutron speed [cm/s]\n  N = atom density [atoms/cm³]\n  Σ = macroscopic cross section = N σ [cm⁻¹]\n  Mean free path: λ = 1/Σ\n```"
    },
