      "text": "**Cross section behavior vs energy:**\n```\nThermal region (E < 1 eV): σ ∝ 1/v  (inversely proportional to velocity)\nResonance region (~1 eV – 1 MeV): sharp peaks (Breit-Wigner resonances)\nFast region (> 1 MeV): smooth, decreasing\n```"
    },
