        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "01 - Nuclear Physics for Engineers",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "**Mechanism (Bohr & Wheeler liquid drop model):**\n```\nn + ²³⁵U → ²³⁶U* (compound nucleus, excited) → fission fragments + 2–3 neutrons + γ + β\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md#036",
      "path": [
        "01-NUCLEAR-PHYSICS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
